# Nurturing Pixie: the first Pixie targets Thraben Inspector; in response Bot2 kills it with Lightning Bolt (Mox Ruby,
# played on turn 2). The only target is illegal when the trigger resolves, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b): the Inspector
# stays in the graveyard, nothing was returned, and that Pixie gets no counter. Positive control, same turn: the second
# Pixie targets the Clue (nothing is in response) and the Clue is returned, so that Pixie grows to 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Nurturing Pixie
Nurturing Pixie
Thraben Inspector
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

